---
import { applications, blockedApplications, registryStatus, runtimes, sizeAccounting } from '../data/project';
---
<section class="one-section shell" id="status" aria-labelledby="status-heading"><header class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Status</p><h2 id="status-heading">Repository live.</h2><p class="lede">Built, signed, published, and verified from a clean Ubuntu 26.04 installation.</p></div><a class="repo" href="https://apt.sharedpair.dev/"><span>Open APT repository</span><strong>apt.sharedpair.dev ↗</strong></a></header><div class="summary"><div><span>Runtimes</span><strong>{runtimes.length} tested</strong></div><div><span>Applications</span><strong>{applications.length} tested</strong></div><div><span>Target</span><strong>Ubuntu 26.04 · {registryStatus.architecture}</strong></div><div><span>Verified</span><strong>{registryStatus.generatedAt}</strong></div></div><div class="accounting"><p class="eyebrow">Measured package set</p><p>Sharing one runtime per line saves <strong>{sizeAccounting.archiveSavedMiB} MiB</strong> ({sizeAccounting.archiveSavedPercent}%) across the tested application cohort, measured from built <code>.deb</code> files.</p></div><div class="holds"><p class="eyebrow">Publication holds</p>{blockedApplications.map((app) => <a href={`#applications-${app.slug}`}><strong>{app.name}</strong><span>{app.proof}</span></a>)}</div></section>
<style>.one-section{padding-block:4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:3rem;align-items:end}.repo{display:block;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid var(--lime);text-decoration:none}.repo span,.summary span{display:block;color:var(--faint);font:.62rem var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase}.repo strong{display:block;margin-top:.5rem;color:var(--lime)}.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.summary div{padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.summary strong{display:block;margin-top:.4rem;font:.78rem var(--mono)}.accounting{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.4rem;border:1px solid var(--line)}.accounting p{margin:0}.accounting p+p{color:var(--muted)}.accounting strong{color:var(--lime)}.holds{margin-top:2rem}.holds>a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none}.holds span{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:760px){.section-heading,.summary,.holds>a{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
